{"vid":"4aFlSEf8C0A","source":"4aFlSEf8C0A.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"A term you're going to hear is the NPSH,"},{"t":2.6,"txt":"which is the acronym for net positive"},{"t":4.5,"txt":"suction pressure. We'll briefly cover"},{"t":6.7,"txt":"what this means."},{"t":8.4,"txt":"There are two letters at the end of the"},{"t":9.8,"txt":"acronym, the NPSHR and the NPSHA."},{"t":13.9,"txt":"The R is the required NPSH. Each pump is"},{"t":17.2,"txt":"tested for this value and this can be"},{"t":19,"txt":"obtained from the pump manufacturer by"},{"t":20.9,"txt":"the pump's operating chart."},{"t":22.9,"txt":"Don't worry about this confusing-looking"},{"t":24.3,"txt":"chart at this point. We're going to"},{"t":26,"txt":"break it down and cover that in detail"},{"t":28,"txt":"in a dedicated video."},{"t":30.1,"txt":"Links to that in the video description"},{"t":31.5,"txt":"down below."},{"t":33.4,"txt":"The R value is basically a warning or"},{"t":35.8,"txt":"danger point. As the water enters the"},{"t":38.2,"txt":"pump and flows into the impeller's eye,"},{"t":40.3,"txt":"it experiences a lot of energy due to"},{"t":42.5,"txt":"the friction. This will give us a"},{"t":44.4,"txt":"pressure drop."},{"t":46.2,"txt":"At certain conditions, the water flowing"},{"t":48.5,"txt":"through the section can reach boiling"},{"t":50.4,"txt":"point. When this occurs, we refer to"},{"t":52.7,"txt":"this as cavitation. We're going to see"},{"t":54.8,"txt":"more on that in just a moment."},{"t":57.3,"txt":"The other letter was the A and this is"},{"t":59.2,"txt":"the NPSH available."},{"t":61.6,"txt":"This depends on the installation of the"},{"t":63.3,"txt":"pump and needs to be calculated. It"},{"t":65.5,"txt":"considers things such as installation"},{"t":67.3,"txt":"type and elevation, liquid temperature,"},{"t":69.5,"txt":"liquid boiling point, et cetera."},{"t":72.3,"txt":"The available pressure should always be"},{"t":74.1,"txt":"higher than the required value."},{"t":76.6,"txt":"For example, if we have an installation"},{"t":78.7,"txt":"and we calculate the NPSHA as 11, but"},{"t":81.6,"txt":"the pump requires an NPSHR of four, then"},{"t":84.2,"txt":"the pump should be okay."},{"t":86.7,"txt":"However, if we installed a pump that"},{"t":88.6,"txt":"required an NPSHR of 13, then the"},{"t":91.2,"txt":"available NPSH is insufficient and"},{"t":93.5,"txt":"cavitation will occur."},{"t":96,"txt":"So, what is cavitation?"},{"t":98.3,"txt":"As we know, water can turn from a liquid"},{"t":100.3,"txt":"state into steam or a gas state."},{"t":103.4,"txt":"We know that water boils at around 100°"},{"t":105.7,"txt":"C"},{"t":106.5,"txt":"and that's because it's at sea level,"},{"t":108.2,"txt":"which has an atmospheric pressure of"},{"t":110,"txt":"101.325"},{"t":111.6,"txt":"kPa."},{"t":113.3,"txt":"But, if we went to the top of Mount"},{"t":115.2,"txt":"Everest, then water boils here at just"},{"t":117.6,"txt":"71° C,"},{"t":119.3,"txt":"and that's because the atmospheric"},{"t":120.6,"txt":"pressure has reduced to 34 KPA."},{"t":124.8,"txt":"As the atmospheric pressure reduces, it"},{"t":126.6,"txt":"becomes easier for the water to boil."},{"t":130.2,"txt":"So, at the suction inlet of the pump, we"},{"t":132.2,"txt":"know that there is going to be a"},{"t":133.3,"txt":"pressure drop. And if this pressure is"},{"t":135.6,"txt":"less than the vapor pressure of the"},{"t":137.1,"txt":"liquid being pumped, then the water can"},{"t":139.2,"txt":"reach boiling point."},{"t":141.1,"txt":"When this happens, cavitation occurs."},{"t":144.1,"txt":"During cavitation, air particles within"},{"t":146.2,"txt":"the water will expand as they reach"},{"t":148.1,"txt":"boiling point. These will then collapse"},{"t":150.4,"txt":"in on themselves very rapidly."},{"t":153,"txt":"As they collapse, they will damage the"},{"t":154.5,"txt":"impeller as well as the pump casing."},{"t":157.2,"txt":"This removes small parts of metal from"},{"t":159.1,"txt":"the surface, and if this keeps"},{"t":160.6,"txt":"occurring, then it will eventually"},{"t":162.2,"txt":"destroy the pump. Therefore, we must"},{"t":164.5,"txt":"ensure the available pressure is higher"},{"t":166.9,"txt":"than the required pressure of the pump."},{"t":170.4,"txt":"Okay, that's it for this video, but to"},{"t":172.2,"txt":"continue learning, then check out one of"},{"t":174,"txt":"the videos on screen now, and I'll catch"},{"t":175.9,"txt":"you there for the next lesson. Don't"},{"t":177.6,"txt":"forget to follow us on Facebook,"},{"t":179,"txt":"Twitter, Instagram, as well as the"},{"t":180.5,"txt":"engineeringmindset.com."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"A"},{"t":0.2,"w":"term"},{"t":0.48,"w":"you're"},{"t":0.6,"w":"going"},{"t":0.76,"w":"to"},{"t":0.88,"w":"hear"},{"t":1.2,"w":"is"},{"t":1.32,"w":"the"},{"t":1.44,"w":"NPSH,"},{"t":2.64,"w":"which"},{"t":2.84,"w":"is"},{"t":2.92,"w":"the"},{"t":3,"w":"acronym"},{"t":3.56,"w":"for"},{"t":3.76,"w":"net"},{"t":4.04,"w":"positive"},{"t":4.52,"w":"suction"},{"t":4.88,"w":"pressure."},{"t":5.88,"w":"We'll"},{"t":6.04,"w":"briefly"},{"t":6.4,"w":"cover"},{"t":6.72,"w":"what"},{"t":6.84,"w":"this"},{"t":7,"w":"means."},{"t":8.44,"w":"There"},{"t":8.6,"w":"are"},{"t":8.68,"w":"two"},{"t":8.88,"w":"letters"},{"t":9.28,"w":"at"},{"t":9.36,"w":"the"},{"t":9.48,"w":"end"},{"t":9.64,"w":"of"},{"t":9.72,"w":"the"},{"t":9.84,"w":"acronym,"},{"t":10.68,"w":"the"},{"t":10.8,"w":"NPSHR"},{"t":12,"w":"and"},{"t":12.12,"w":"the"},{"t":12.2,"w":"NPSHA."},{"t":13.92,"w":"The"},{"t":14.12,"w":"R"},{"t":14.44,"w":"is"},{"t":14.56,"w":"the"},{"t":14.64,"w":"required"},{"t":15.28,"w":"NPSH."},{"t":16.52,"w":"Each"},{"t":16.76,"w":"pump"},{"t":17,"w":"is"},{"t":17.16,"w":"tested"},{"t":17.68,"w":"for"},{"t":17.88,"w":"this"},{"t":18.08,"w":"value"},{"t":18.56,"w":"and"},{"t":18.68,"w":"this"},{"t":18.76,"w":"can"},{"t":18.88,"w":"be"},{"t":18.96,"w":"obtained"},{"t":19.4,"w":"from"},{"t":19.52,"w":"the"},{"t":19.64,"w":"pump"},{"t":19.